# RimWorld 1.7 pass (AUDIT.md "Passe 1.7"): the tools pass on 1.7, for features 01 to 06 (not 07, 08).
# Tool folders are net10.0 builds of the 1.7 session, copied into PickleTools/Build17 (repo-relative, so a server lane can play 1.7), read by a path relative to the rimworld root.
# ScreenshotStudio carries "I let N ticks pass", the wait with a long deadline (Pickle's own "I wait N ticks" stops at 5 s on 1.7).
nelim.pickletools.inspecttabs      path:PickleTools/Build17/InspectTabs
nelim.pickletools.screenshotstudio path:PickleTools/Build17/ScreenshotStudio
nelim.pickletools.screenshotmode   path:PickleTools/Build17/ScreenshotMode
# The bundle is committed under PickleTools/Mod: this shell replaces it (see StandaloneBase).
nelim.pickletools   path:PickleTools/Tests/Pickle/StandaloneBase/Mod
